# 本地模型（encoder 单文件超 GitHub 100MB 限，走 fetch 脚本引导，不入库）
# Local models (encoder files exceed GitHub's 100MB limit; bootstrap via fetch script).
# 目录按能力划分：models/{vad,kws,asr,tts,llm}；体积小的 KWS 模型仍随仓库入库。
# Layout by capability: models/{vad,kws,asr,tts,llm}; the small KWS model stays committed.
models/asr/*/
models/tts/*/
models/vad/*.onnx
models/llm/*/
models/_*.tar.bz2
models/*.tar.bz2
